<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 1.0 bln Czech crown 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 1.0 bln Czech crown 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Woodcommerz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN - UND WECHSEL BANK</p>
<p> AMT   1.0 BLN CZK    COUPON     12.0	MATURITY    05.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101	 PAY DATE    05.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 DENOMS (K) 25-250-1M SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.00</p>
<p> NOTES	**CZ/US/UK/DE</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		1.0 BILLION CZECH CROWN = ($29.5 million)</p>
<p>					 ($ = 33.88 Czech Crowns)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
